{"id":2279,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>三月春风拂暖，雷锋精神永续。为传承“奉献、友爱、互助、进步”的志愿精神，推动学雷锋活动走深走实，我院举办了“以青春之名，赴雷锋之约”主题志愿服务活动。全校同学积极响应、热情参与，以线下实践与线上公益相结合的形式，将青春力量汇聚成温暖暖流，为山区孩子送去关怀与希望。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMmltboRGanlnRojll4nmWRMmGinzNw8UlVkU8-4U8LYMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyiUShRnSyiUznfLRLsU8-iLR74nlnRnmLDoRrRnlUsLzMFnmlbM4Ako7VFMNWRozGJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E5ACE5A4A037CB5013EDCF3685CED713/F5978B8A/6BC90\" vheight=\" 300px\" vwidth=\" 532px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMmltboRGanlnRojll4nmWRMmGinzNw8UlVkU8-4U8LYMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyiUShRnSyiUznfLRLsU8-iLR74nlnRnmLDoRrRnlUsLzMFnmlbM4Ako7VFMNWRozGJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\"></p><p>活动现场暖意融融、氛围热烈，同学们在多个特色区域中践行雷锋精神：</p><p>- 明信片寄语书写区：同学们伏案提笔，将对山区孩子的祝福与鼓励化作一行行真挚文字，一张张明信片承载着温暖期许，跨越山海传递善意与力量。</p><p>- 手工作品制作区：大家发挥创意与巧思，制作石膏娃娃，黏土作品 手绘卡等手工艺品，每一件作品都饱含着对公益的热忱，也让同学们在动手实践中体会“奉献他人、提升自己”的快乐。</p><p>- 爱心树打卡区：同学们将写有心愿的便签贴在爱心树上，合影打卡定格温暖瞬间，用青春身影诠释雷锋精神的时代内涵，营造出“人人学雷锋、处处暖人心”的校园氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=To77tiLRGYL8LiLj7VfM4AVMNn7Lmnw2ozLaL8LYMRvPoz90gihFp2hmCIa0LYhRMShVLSy8MmCPUzVVLmlanlQfMNl8LNMfMRGiLzLbLRrFo7UYLz-sMRnFMN7YMRCJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3C5E14661A1E250EFA6E42CA40513905/8D212744/6A246\" vheight=\" 275px\" vwidth=\" 529px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=To77tiLRGYL8LiLj7VfM4AVMNn7Lmnw2ozLaL8LYMRvPoz90gihFp2hmCIa0LYhRMShVLSy8MmCPUzVVLmlanlQfMNl8LNMfMRGiLzLbLRrFo7UYLz-sMRnFMN7YMRCJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\"></p><p>线下活动之外，同学们同步参与线上打卡集爱心值活动，通过分享活动瞬间、传播志愿理念积累爱心值，最终将爱心值兑换为文具、书籍、健康包等爱心物资，定向捐赠给山区儿童，助力他们健康成长、逐梦前行。</p><p>此次活动将雷锋精神与公益实践深度融合，既让同学们在沉浸式体验中感悟志愿精神的魅力，也以实际行动为山区孩子点亮希望。未来，我院将持续推动学雷锋活动常态化开展，引导更多青年学子以青春之我、担时代之责，让雷锋精神在新时代绽放更加璀璨的光芒。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMNCtYLRVVMl7iMjmlYMR9YnRW7L8LwinlrRoRN8nRviUml0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyPn1yDLYyDMmNYLlQ7MmfkMNU8LNL4LzNbMlL8LNUiMmMFU4M2nm62nNrFLznRMmvJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/51F6366921FD60B6D42C31995C42D563/C3FF7FFE/14C67\" vheight=\" 278px\" vwidth=\" 552px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TLNUtsnmCiUl-bojzGsLzCDLRlinR6wkU4lDL4AVMmAkLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0oShVL1yYn1yYMRlYUzA7nlCDMmGPU4NPU8lZUzV7MRA2MlrFL7UYMNQknznFoRW2UlCJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TozCt8MmMVUl-YUj8nVLRfkL4TfLzQwfoRCZUlC4MNlaMzv0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyPn1yiUYyiolWVMm6kLRCYMzvsLzvDLmvbMm7ZolW2U8rFMRvsLmrVMNWFMzA2okbaptveo4Oeq2XbC570qIbtpYyPLRvsg47aL47DgtA8pUXcc&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/31F5C59BE67B0625771762796189BFCE/47725E6B/58F8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMzVt7olMRL7UYUjNLsol-iUmC8M8UwYoR9ZnlLaLR-bUlU0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyiLkhRn1yYnN-aUzlbnR-YnlMkU8UPMm-anzffnmAVnlnFL7C4MN7bUzTFU4lYnmCJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hjaq.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=TMmltboRGanlnRojll4nmWRMmGinzNw8UlVkU8-4U8LYMRv0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyiUShRnSyiUznfLRLsU8-iLR74nlnRnmLDoRrRnlUsLzMFnmlbM4Ako7VFMNWRozGJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLRLPM1bw62X8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=10316&e=.png"}